ompensa.","26":"Carrera: La maldici\u00f3n de las jalrogines","28":"Interactuar con los monstruos"},"fr":{"24":"Les Boufrogounets sont en fait des Bouftous qui ont \u00e9t\u00e9 malencontreusement r\u00e9incarn\u00e9s dans des flammes. Les Boufrogs de la Pandalousie sont moins purs que ceux de Br\u00e2kmar, il suffit de les asperger d''un peu d''eau (sal\u00e9e ou pas sal\u00e9e) pour les lib\u00e9rer de leur triste condition. Interagissez avec un d''entre eux le plus vite possible pour obtenir la r\u00e9compense.","26":"Course : La mal\u00e9diction des Boufrogounets","28":"Interagir avec les monstres"}},"scenario_id":-1899},"original_template_membership_recovered":false,"reconstruction":"User-authorized named-type native variant, not original template membership","selected_species":{"family_id":1034,"illustration_id":100202009,"loot_definitions":[],"max_level":1,"min_level":1,"name":"Jalrog\u00edn","native_abilities":[],"raw_visual_arrays":{"csb":[],"csc":[13,20,7],"csu":[]},"ref":5066,"sprite_id":100201314,"statistics":{"AP":{"base":6,"per_level":0.0},"HP":{"base":1,"per_level":0.0},"INIT":{"base":0,"per_level":0.0},"MP":{"base":3,"per_level":0.0},"WP":{"base":0,"per_level":0.0}}},"taxonomy_family_ids":[],"taxonomy_proof":"blj.dvY/dvZ -> cqM -> DQ/DR -> aTF.a/b(38, familyID)","variant_selection":"positive-native-HP; direct candidate before identical sprite bridge; minimum native reference"}'::jsonb,'3106c043701c78a9aeece275573349a7efd645f3ab6289118aa6dbb5b6f6f90b');
