\u00e9tait propice \u00e0 leur int\u00e9gration dans l''\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me, mais ces nuisibles font une v\u00e9ritable cacophonie \u00e0 toute heure de la journ\u00e9e et de la nuit. Il est temps de leur apprendre les bonnes mani\u00e8res ! Interagissez avec eux le nombre de fois indiqu\u00e9 pour obtenir la r\u00e9compense.","26":"Solo : Les Crapauds polis et polyvalents","28":"Interagir avec les monstres"}},"scenario_id":-1892},"original_template_membership_recovered":false,"reconstruction":"User-authorized named-type native variant, not original template membership","selected_species":{"family_id":1034,"illustration_id":-1,"loot_definitions":[],"max_level":1,"min_level":1,"name":"Sapo livalente","native_abilities":[],"raw_visual_arrays":{"csb":[],"csc":[13,20,7],"csu":[]},"ref":5064,"sprite_id":104000464,"statistics":{"AP":{"base":6,"per_level":0.0},"HP":{"base":1,"per_level":0.0},"INIT":{"base":0,"per_level":0.0},"MP":{"base":3,"per_level":0.0},"WP":{"base":0,"per_level":0.0}}},"taxonomy_family_ids":[],"taxonomy_proof":"blj.dvY/dvZ -> cqM -> DQ/DR -> aTF.a/b(38, familyID)","variant_selection":"positive-native-HP; direct candidate before identical sprite bridge; minimum native reference"}'::jsonb,'582bf2ed307dc36bae6fc9e8493c0a4404154014f3f372ac97c6fdd439706d72');
